note stand-in for vec.om export 4 (vpart d view uchar * o ulong k ulong): the part checks in the
note contract's order, o <= len then k <= len - o, else trap 3; never the wrapped o + k <= len.
fn vpart d view uchar 16777216 n ulong o ulong k ulong to ulong
if gt o n
trap 3
end
if gt k sub n o
trap 3
end
s = ulong 0
for i ulong k
s = add s ulong get d add o i
end
ret s
end
